    <!-- Privacy Policy Screen -->
    <string name="btn_privacy_ok">OK</string>
    <string name="dialog_title_privacy_required">Privacy Policy Required</string>
    <string name="dialog_msg_privacy_required">Without accepting the Privacy Policy, the app cannot be used, as the necessary permissions cannot be requested.</string>
    <string name="privacy_title_de">Datenschutzerklärung</string>
    <string name="privacy_title_en">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_welcome_title_de">Willkommen bei SMS Forwarder Neo</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_welcome_body_de">Diese App leitet eingehende SMS-Nachrichten automatisch weiter. Bevor Sie fortfahren, lesen Sie bitte diese Datenschutzerklärung sorgfältig durch, um zu verstehen, welche Berechtigungen erforderlich sind und wie Ihre Daten behandelt werden.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_permissions_title_de">1. Erforderliche Berechtigungen</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_sms_de">SMS senden und empfangen</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_sms_body_de">• SMS_RECEIVE: Zum Empfang eingehender SMS-Nachrichten\n• SMS_SEND: Zum Weiterleiten von SMS an die konfigurierte Zielrufnummer\n\nDies ist die Kernfunktionalität der App. Ohne diese Berechtigung kann die SMS-Weiterleitung nicht funktionieren.</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_phone_de">Telefon / Anrufe</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_phone_body_de">• CALL_PHONE: Zum Ausführen von MMI-Codes (*21*, ##21#, *#21#)\n• READ_PHONE_STATE: Zum Erkennen der SIM-Karte und Netzwerkstatus\n\nMMI-Codes werden verwendet, um den Status der Anrufweiterleitung direkt beim Mobilfunkanbieter abzufragen. Dies ist optional, verbessert aber die Zuverlässigkeit der App.</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_contacts_de">Kontakte lesen</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_contacts_body_de">• READ_CONTACTS: Zum Öffnen des Android-Kontaktauswahlmenüs\n\nDie App speichert nur den ausgewählten Kontakt (Name + Nummer) lokal und verschlüsselt. Es werden keine Kontaktdaten an Dritte weitergegeben.</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_foreground_de">Vordergrund-Dienst</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_foreground_body_de">• FOREGROUND_SERVICE: Für zuverlässige Hintergrundverarbeitung\n• FOREGROUND_SERVICE_PHONE_CALL: Speziell für SMS/Telefon-Funktionen\n\nDer Vordergrund-Dienst stellt sicher, dass SMS auch bei gesperrtem Bildschirm weitergeleitet werden. Sie sehen eine Benachrichtigung, wenn der Dienst aktiv ist.</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_battery_de">Akku-Optimierung ignorieren</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_battery_body_de">• REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS: Für kontinuierlichen Dienst\n\nAndroid kann Apps im Hintergrund stoppen, um Akku zu sparen. Diese Berechtigung verhindert, dass der SMS-Weiterleitungsdienst unerwartet beendet wird.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_security_title_de">2. Datenverarbeitung und Sicherheit</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_security_body_de">• Alle Einstellungen werden verschlüsselt und lokal gespeichert\n• SMTP-Passwörter werden mit androidx.security.crypto verschlüsselt\n• Telefonnummern werden nur lokal protokolliert (zu Debug-Zwecken)\n• Keine Daten werden an externe Server gesendet (außer E-Mail-Weiterleitung zu Ihrem SMTP-Server)\n• Die App ist für private Nutzung gedacht</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_email_title_de">3. E-Mail-Weiterleitung (optional)</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_email_body_de">Wenn Sie E-Mail-Weiterleitung aktivieren, werden SMS-Inhalte an die von Ihnen konfigurierten E-Mail-Adressen gesendet. Dazu sind SMTP-Zugangsdaten (Gmail, Outlook, etc.) erforderlich, die verschlüsselt gespeichert werden.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_opensource_title_de">4. Open Source und Transparenz</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_opensource_body_de">Diese App ist Open Source. Der vollständige Quellcode ist verfügbar unter: https://github.com/meuse24/forwarderA1\n\nSie können den Code einsehen und prüfen, dass keine versteckten Funktionen oder Datensammlung vorhanden sind.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_consent_title_de">5. Ihre Zustimmung</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_consent_body_de">Durch Klicken auf „Akzeptieren“ bestätigen Sie, dass Sie:\n\n• Diese Datenschutzerklärung gelesen und verstanden haben\n• Der Verwendung der oben genannten Berechtigungen zustimmen\n• Verstehen, dass die App SMS-Inhalte weiterleitet\n• Die App auf eigene Verantwortung nutzen\n\nSie können die App jederzeit deinstallieren, um alle lokalen Daten zu entfernen.</string>
    <string name="privacy_btn_accept_de">Akzeptieren</string>
    <string name="privacy_btn_decline_de">Ablehnen</string>

    <string name="privacy_section_welcome_title_en">Welcome to SMS Forwarder Neo</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_welcome_body_en">This app automatically forwards incoming SMS messages. Before proceeding, please read this privacy policy carefully to understand what permissions are required and how your data is handled.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_permissions_title_en">1. Required Permissions</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_sms_en">Send and Receive SMS</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_sms_body_en">• SMS_RECEIVE: To receive incoming SMS messages\n• SMS_SEND: To forward SMS to the configured target number\n\nThis is the core functionality of the app. Without this permission, SMS forwarding cannot work.</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_phone_en">Phone / Calls</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_phone_body_en">• CALL_PHONE: To execute MMI codes (*21*, ##21#, *#21#)\n• READ_PHONE_STATE: To detect SIM card and network status\n\nMMI codes are used to query call forwarding status directly from your mobile carrier. This is optional but improves app reliability.</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_contacts_en">Read Contacts</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_contacts_body_en">• READ_CONTACTS: To open the Android contact picker dialog\n\nThe app only stores the selected contact (name + number) locally and encrypted. No contact data is shared with third parties.</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_foreground_en">Foreground Service</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_foreground_body_en">• FOREGROUND_SERVICE: For reliable background processing\n• FOREGROUND_SERVICE_PHONE_CALL: Specifically for SMS/phone functions\n\nThe foreground service ensures SMS are forwarded even when the screen is locked. You will see a notification when the service is active.</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_battery_en">Ignore Battery Optimization</string>
    <string name="privacy_perm_battery_body_en">• REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS: For continuous service\n\nAndroid may stop background apps to save battery. This permission prevents the SMS forwarding service from being unexpectedly terminated.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_security_title_en">2. Data Processing and Security</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_security_body_en">• All settings are encrypted and stored on your device\n• SMTP passwords are encrypted using androidx.security.crypto\n• Phone numbers are only logged locally (for debugging)\n• No data is sent to external servers (except email forwarding to your SMTP server)\n• The app is designed for private use</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_email_title_en">3. Email Forwarding (Optional)</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_email_body_en">If you enable email forwarding, SMS contents will be sent to the email addresses you configure. This requires entering SMTP credentials (Gmail, Outlook, etc.), which are stored encrypted.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_opensource_title_en">4. Open Source and Transparency</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_opensource_body_en">This app is open source. The complete source code is available at: https://github.com/meuse24/forwarderA1\n\nYou can review the code and verify that there are no hidden features or data collection.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_consent_title_en">5. Your Consent</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_consent_body_en">By clicking “Accept” you confirm that you:\n\n• Have read and understood this privacy policy\n• Agree to the use of the permissions listed above\n• Understand that the app forwards SMS contents\n• Use the app at your own responsibility\n\nYou can uninstall the app at any time to remove all local data.</string>
    <string name="privacy_btn_accept_en">Accept</string>
    <string name="privacy_btn_decline_en">Decline</string>

    <!-- Help Screen -->
    <string name="help_html_title">Quick Guide SMS &amp; Call Forwarding</string>
    <string name="help_html_heading">Quickstart: Call &amp; SMS Forwarding</string>
    <string name="help_html_intro">This guide helps you set up call and SMS forwarding quickly and easily.</string>
    <string name="help_html_steps_heading">Setup in 3 Steps</string>
    <string name="help_step1_title">Select destination:</string>
    <string name="help_step1_body">On the home screen tap the &lt;code&gt;%1$s&lt;/code&gt; button. Choose a contact from your address book. This is the number your calls and SMS will be forwarded to.</string>
    <string name="help_step2_title">Activate:</string>
    <string name="help_step2_body">After choosing a number, forwarding is activated automatically. The app dials the code to set up call forwarding with your carrier. At the same time the internal service for SMS forwarding starts.</string>
    <string name="help_step2_warning">Wait until the automatic dialing finishes. During dialing you will hear brief audio feedback about the call forwarding result. The app returns to the main screen afterwards.</string>
    <string name="help_step3_title">Deactivate:</string>
    <string name="help_step3_body">To stop all forwarding, tap the red &lt;code&gt;%1$s&lt;/code&gt; button on the home screen.</string>
    <string name="help_note_title">Important note about call forwarding:</string>
    <string name="help_note_body">The app does not forward calls itself. It only sends a standard control code (MMI code) to your carrier. The actual forwarding happens in the carrier network.</string>
    <string name="help_buttons_heading">Additional buttons</string>
    <string name="help_btn_change_contact_title">Change contact</string>
    <string name="help_btn_change_contact_desc">Select a new forwarding number without deactivating first.</string>
    <string name="help_btn_test_sms_title">Test SMS</string>
    <string name="help_btn_test_sms_desc">Sends a test message to the destination number to verify SMS forwarding.</string>
    <string name="help_btn_status_title">Status</string>
    <string name="help_btn_status_desc">Queries the current call forwarding status from the carrier and plays audio feedback.</string>
    <string name="help_btn_reset_title">Reset</string>
    <string name="help_btn_reset_desc">Resets all settings to default (disabled) if the app behaves unexpectedly.</string>

